{{Quote|I can't remember the last time I was in a refresher.''"<br />"[Rey points to a set of doors] ''Fully functional.''"<br />"''You serious?''"<br />"''No water, but the sonics work.|Devi and [[Rey Skywalker|Rey]]|<ref name="BTA">''[[Before the Awakening]]''</ref>}}
[[File:Refresher.png|thumb|right|230px|[[Cassian Jeron Andor|Cassian Andor]] in the refresher on [[Niamos]].]]
A '''refresher''',<ref name="BTA" /> also known as a '''lavatory''',<ref name="Voice of the Empire">{{InsiderCite|170|The Voice of the Empire}}</ref> a '''bathroom''',<ref name="Poe Dameron 17">[[Poe Dameron 17|''Poe Dameron'' 17]]</ref> a '''restroom''',<ref name="Dark Disciple">''[[Dark Disciple]]''</ref> a '''privy''',<ref name="Chapter 10">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 10: The Passenger}}</ref> or, colloquially, a '''fresher''',<ref name="CL" /> was a room designed for personal hygiene. They could be found in numerous locations, such as [[Imperial Academy|Imperial academies]]<ref name="TSA">''[[Servants of the Empire: The Secret Academy]]''</ref> or [[starship]]s such as the [[690 light freighter]]. Some restrooms contained [[Sonic shower|sonics]], which could be used in the absence of [[water]].<ref name="BTA" /> Certain refresher units were capable of turning the wastes into compost.<ref name="CL">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> At the [[Resistance base]] on [[D'Qar]], there were rows of refreshers, each with a symbol of a drop of water on its door.<ref name="Join the Resistance">''[[Join the Resistance]]''</ref> According to [[Finn]], a former [[First Order]] [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtrooper]], there were 1,822 bathrooms on a First Order [[Star Destroyer]].<ref name="Choose Your Destiny">''[[Choose Your Destiny: A Finn & Poe Adventure]]''</ref> [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine's]] [[Emperor's office|office]] had a private refresher.<ref name="CL" />

